ChorusDraft desktop launcher

The launcher source is distributed under Apache License 2.0 with ChorusDraft.
The desktop interface uses React (MIT) and Electron (MIT and included Chromium
third-party licenses). The packaged terminal bridge includes Python (PSF License)
and PyInstaller's bootloader (GPLv2 with its distribution exception).
Windows builds additionally include pywinpty (MIT License).

